      {
        "id": 35580,
        "name": "awp832",
        "username": "awp832",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-01T21:09:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m torn on this one.    My tendency is to say that sidekicks are something to be avoided.   In general, sidekicks were a thing of 40 years ago.    Now adays sidekicks are out,   a forgotten relic and painful reminder of when superheroes were posterboys for cheesy dialogue and campy visual effects.    I don’t think we want to bring that into SotM in a meaningful way.</p>",
